["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">通</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>通过；交通；往来；信件计数；通道</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ツウ・ツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とお.る・とお.り・-とお.り・-どお.り・とお.す・とお.し・-どお.し・かよ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">通う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">往来于；在...之间来回；来回奔走；去；上；出入；定期前往；流通；传导；传播；相似；相像</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交通</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">交通；运输；交流；沟通；往来；交际</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">通る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とおる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经过；通过；沿着；取道；走（某条路）；运行；运营；开通（交通线路）；进屋；入室；被准许进入；被引进；穿透；刺穿；贯穿；透过；渗透；浸透；遍及；传播；传达（如声音）；远达；转达；转告；被传达（如顾客的订单）；通过；批准；获准；被接受；以...的名义为人所知；被认可为；享有...的声誉；连贯；合理；有逻辑；易懂；讲得通；被理解；表达清楚；看起来像；显得；给人...的印象；笔直；（如木纹）顺直；见多识广；睿智；彻底完成；充分地做</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">言</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>说；话；言语</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲン・ゴン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.う・こと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">言う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说；说话；讲；表述；取名；命名；称呼；发出声音；响起</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">言葉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">语言；方言；词；短语；表达；术语；言语；说话方式；语言运用；话语；言辞；陈述；评论；学语；语言习得</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">言語</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">语言</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">理</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>道理；条理；理由；正义；真理</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ことわり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">料理</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烹饪；烹调；菜肴；食物；菜；妥善处理；巧妙应对；打理；料理</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地理</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地理</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">無理</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不合理；不自然；无正当理由；不可能；强行的；勉强的；强制的；过度的；过量的；过度劳累；过分努力；不可能；没门；做梦吧；（数学）无理的（如无理数）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">体</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>身体；物体；实体；形态；图像（计数单位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ・テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">からだ・かたち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">体</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">からだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">身体；躯干；躯体；体型；身材；体格；健康；体质；身体状况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大体</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だいたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大体上；总的来说；大致；基本上；大约；左右；大致的；粗略的；概要；要点；梗概；主旨；实质；本来；首先；从一开始；原本</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一体</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いったい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">究竟；到底（加强疑问语气）；一个物体；一个整体；一个单位；一个群体；一团；一种形式；一种样式；一种格式；一种风格；一尊佛像；一件雕刻；一件雕塑；一具尸体；一份遗骨；一份遗骸；总体上；一般来说；总的来讲；大体而言；基本上；严格来说；首先；原本；本来</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">田</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>稻田</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">デン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">田舎</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いなか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乡村；乡下；僻壤；故乡；家乡</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">田</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">た</span><span class=\"k-wz\">稻田；水田</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">田植え</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たうえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">水稻插秧；插秧</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">主</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>主人；主要；主君；首领；主（事物）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュ・ス・シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬし・おも・あるじ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">御主人</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごしゅじん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">您丈夫；尊夫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">主に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おもに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">主要地；主要；大部分；多半</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">主義</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">学说；规则；原则；-主义</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">題</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>主题；题目；标题</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿題</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">功课；作业；悬而未决的问题；未解决的课题</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">問題</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もんだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">题目；试题；问题；问题；难题；课题；事项；事件；疑问；怀疑；公开讨论；争议；论争；麻烦；困难；不便</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">題</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">标题；主题；题目；题材；（考试）题目；问题；（计数考试题目的量词）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">意</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>意义；想法；心意；愿望；喜好</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意味</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">意义；含义；意思</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意見</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">意见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">注意</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">注意；留意；小心；谨慎；留意；警惕；忠告；警告；提醒；劝诫；训斥；批评；斥责</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">不</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>否定；非；不好；丑陋；笨拙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ・ブ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不便</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふべん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不便；不方便；麻烦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不-；非-</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不安</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふあん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不安；忧虑；担心；焦虑；恐惧；缺乏安全感；悬念</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">作</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>制作；生产；准备；建造</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サク・サ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つく.る・つく.り・-づく.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作文</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">写作（文章、散文等）；作文；空洞的正式文章；形式化的写作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つくる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">制造；生产；制作；建造；建设；烹饪；酿造；养育；种植；栽培；训练；耕种；开垦；起草；制定；准备；写；创作；谱写；创造；组织；建立；创办；生（孩子）；生育；化妆；装扮；编造；捏造；假装；装出；作出虚假的样子；排成；形成；创下（纪录）；犯下；作下</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工作；操作；任务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">用</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>使用；用途；事务；服务；采用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もち.いる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事务；差事；任务；用途；用处；供……使用；为……而作；生理需要；排泄</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用意</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">准备；安排；整理；摆设</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用事</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事务；差事；约定；事情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">度</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>次数；度（角度/温度等）；程度；每次；考虑</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ド・ト・タク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たび・-た.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">もう一度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もういちど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">再一次；又一遍</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いちど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一次；一回；一遍；暂时；片刻；一时；一度；一个音程</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">这次；现在；下次；改天；不久；很快；最近；近来；前些天</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">強</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>强大；强硬；加强；勉强；强行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ゴウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つよ.い・つよ.まる・つよ.める・し.いる・こわ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つよい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">强大；有力；专横；坚韧；强壮；魁梧；有力；健壮；粗犷；擅长；熟练；精通；能够应对；会处理；耐用；耐得住；有韧性；坚固；刚硬；牢实；强烈；猛烈；激烈；高度；可靠；值得信赖</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勉強</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">学习；研究；勤奋；刻苦；经验；教训；折扣；优惠；降价</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強調</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうちょう</span