lass=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便宜；廉价；平静；安宁；安静</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安全；保障</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">心</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>心；内心；精神；心思；感情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こころ・-ごころ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こころ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">心灵；思想；精神；（谜语等的）含义；意思</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">心配</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">担心；忧虑；焦虑；不安；恐惧；关心；照料；帮助；援助；协助</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">界</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>世界；边界</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">世界；社会；宇宙；领域；圈子；（某一）界；世界闻名的；享誉世界的；（佛教）佛国；一佛所统摄的世界</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">限界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">极限；界限；限度</span></li><li><span clas