-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.る・う.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">売る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">销售；出售；背叛；出卖；使自己出名；树立声誉；挑衅；挑起；强加于人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うりば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">销售区；柜台；（商场的）楼层；部门；（商品的）畅销时机；好卖的时候</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">商売</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贸易；商业；买卖；职业；行业；工作</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">知</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>知道；告知；智慧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">し.る・し.らせる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知道；了解；意识到；得知；发现；感觉；感受；察觉；意识到；理解；领会；掌握；体会；记得；熟悉；认识；经历；经受；体验（如艰辛）；认识（某人）；结识；与……有关；与……相关；是某人分内之事；是某人的责任</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承知</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知晓；知悉；接受；同意；答应；应允；遵从；认可；原谅；宽恕；包容</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知らせる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しらせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">通知；告知；让人知道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">道</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>道路；街道；地区；路程；道德</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ・トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みち・いう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道路；小径；街道；巷道；通道；路线；路途；距离；旅程；途径；进程；生活方式；正道；道德准则；教义；教诲；学说；领域；学科；专业；手段；方法；办法</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">柔道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">柔道</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">水道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自来水</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">集</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>聚集；集合；收集；群集；汇集</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あつ.まる・あつ.める・つど.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">聚集；汇集；集合</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">收集</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">集団</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">集团；团体；群体</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">別</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>分离；分开；区别；另外；特别</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ベツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わか.れる・わ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">別</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">区别；差异；差别；单独的；不同的；另外的；额外的；例外；除外；按照；根据；分类</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">特別</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とくべつ</span>